(6389197, 946342, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition. I think in your processing you have smoothed out the textures a bit too much. Whether through de-noise or whatever process you used. It just doesn''t look natural and it is over-processed in that respect. It might be over-sharpened because I can see some digital artifacts around the outlines of the petals, leaves and stem. (perhaps that is due to the processing on the sky.</td>', 'Great color and composition. I think in your processing you have smoothed out the textures a bit too much. Whether through de-noise or whatever process you used. It just doesn''t look natural and it is over-processed in that respect. It might be over-sharpened because I can see some digital artifacts around the outlines of the petals, leaves and stem. (perhaps that is due to the processing on the sky.', '2011-04-18 09:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6389199, 946837, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good concept. Very natural. The catch lights in the eyes are great. Only drawback is the photo is lacking luminosity. Otherwise excellent.</td>', 'Good concept. Very natural. The catch lights in the eyes are great. Only drawback is the photo is lacking luminosity. Otherwise excellent.', '2011-04-18 09:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
