(6390200, 946802, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but I am having trouble liking the processing, especially because of the loss of detail and the posterization (e.g., at right, the out of focus pansies).  The pansies certaily burst with colour though.  May I ask, why the strong processing?  Why the posterization?  It looks like a beautiful photo that could stand without that processing (just my opinion).</td>', 'I like the photo, but I am having trouble liking the processing, especially because of the loss of detail and the posterization (e.g., at right, the out of focus pansies).  The pansies certaily burst with colour though.  May I ask, why the strong processing?  Why the posterization?  It looks like a beautiful photo that could stand without that processing (just my opinion).', '2011-04-19 12:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
