(6394094, 946811, 114225, '<td valign="top">This does me the challenge, but overall, it''s only a mid0quality image. Mainly this is due to the very hard lighting. Do you see those extreme black shadows with very defined edges? That''s what is telling me a hard light (on camera flash perhaps) was used. Diffuse the light, and I bet this would look quite a bit better.</td>', 'This does me the challenge, but overall, it''s only a mid0quality image. Mainly this is due to the very hard lighting. Do you see those extreme black shadows with very defined edges? That''s what is telling me a hard light (on camera flash perhaps) was used. Diffuse the light, and I bet this would look quite a bit better.', '2011-04-24 14:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6394095, 946792, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of scene depth.</td>', 'Very nice use of scene depth.', '2011-04-24 14:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
