(6394137, 946753, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful display, and nicely captured. You did well removing any distracting background while leaving just a bit of context.</td>', 'This is a beautiful display, and nicely captured. You did well removing any distracting background while leaving just a bit of context.', '2011-04-24 17:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6394138, 946851, 114225, '<td valign="top">Spectacular. Were those clouds rolling in or out? Either easy, nice job.</td>', 'Spectacular. Were those clouds rolling in or out? Either easy, nice job.', '2011-04-24 17:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6394139, 946355, 114225, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the muted tones of this image, gives it a certain mood that full saturation wouldn''t.</td>', 'I enjoy the muted tones of this image, gives it a certain mood that full saturation wouldn''t.', '2011-04-24 17:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6394140, 946879, 114225, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this photo, the better it becomes. Fantastic job.</td>', 'The more I look at this photo, the better it becomes. Fantastic job.', '2011-04-24 17:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6394142, 946796, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of selective de-saturation.</td>', 'Lovely use of selective de-saturation.', '2011-04-24 17:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6394143, 946840, 114225, '<td valign="top">I see what you are going for here, but I think two things are hurting this photo. First is that the focus doesn''t seem super sharp; for a photo like this, you need focus that is spot on.<br/> <br/>But more important is the lighting. Looks like you may have diffused your light a bit, but not quite enough. I''m still seeing some hard lines to the shadows instead of the light wrapping around the watch to really make the watch itself pop. I think the softer light would also help reduce the reflections.</td>', 'I see what you are going for here, but I think two things are hurting this photo. First is that the focus doesn''t seem super sharp; for a photo like this, you need focus that is spot on. But more important is the lighting. Looks like you may have diffused your light a bit, but not quite enough. I''m still seeing some hard lines to the shadows instead of the light wrapping around the watch to really make the watch itself pop. I think the softer light would also help reduce the reflections.', '2011-04-24 17:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6394144, 946320, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  I really like how you positioned the girl so that the reflection of the rainbow runs under the umbrella and into her face.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  I really like how you positioned the girl so that the reflection of the rainbow runs under the umbrella and into her face.', '2011-04-24 17:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6394149, 946872, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s very cool how you used the fern to radiate from the flowers. Adds a lot of extra interest.</td>', 'That''s very cool how you used the fern to radiate from the flowers. Adds a lot of extra interest.', '2011-04-24 17:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
