(6394542, 946879, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I went out for a walk with the family today, and spotted some wildflowers by a stream. I took a quick snapshot (no tripod or macro lens with me) so I could look them up later and figure out what they were. Thanks for <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=947965" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">saving me the trouble.</a></td>', 'Beautiful! I went out for a walk with the family today, and spotted some wildflowers by a stream. I took a quick snapshot (no tripod or macro lens with me) so I could look them up later and figure out what they were. Thanks for saving me the trouble.', '2011-04-25 02:04:34.000000', NULL, 0),
