(6420880, 946878, 130694, '<td valign="top">So my return of the comment :) <br/> <br/>I liked the image, I liked the colors and the separation of the colors, I personally would have liked to have seen the inside of the petals a bit more crisp, tho the definition of the edges are great. Also those front two petals are a little blown out, so you dont get their detail either.</td>', 'So my return of the comment :)  I liked the image, I liked the colors and the separation of the colors, I personally would have liked to have seen the inside of the petals a bit more crisp, tho the definition of the edges are great. Also those front two petals are a little blown out, so you dont get their detail either.', '2011-05-21 22:20:04.000000', NULL, 0),
