(6608110, 946468, 17507, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=45631" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">RamblinR</a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1114894&amp;page=1#6608026" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">mentioned this photo in a forum post</a> --<br/> <br/>I agree, this shot is awesome, both on its own terms and as judged against the (apparently many!) steel-wool-burn photos that have been discussed and linked to lately. Very nicely done.<br/> <br/><i>edited for less-ugly formatting... {user} tags seem to mess things up</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-12-01 19:33:03.</i></td>', ' RamblinR mentioned this photo in a forum post -- I agree, this shot is awesome, both on its own terms and as judged against the (apparently many!) steel-wool-burn photos that have been discussed and linked to lately. Very nicely done. edited for less-ugly formatting... {user} tags seem to mess things up', '2011-12-01 19:32:20.000000', '2011-12-01 19:33:03.000000', 0),
